{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1000_p", "source_sha256": "515f8bddd876a821db4cc6b100db32dd15afec8b3d4ff4469c5aa3e642341c0a", "ja": "（今日は風花とクリスマスマーケットに行ってきた。\nとても賑やかだったが、人も多かったな……）", "zh": "（今天和风花一起去了圣诞集市。虽然非常热闹，但人也真多啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6f3c8d942f480b32366c59b02f4ef7e1ab9a8e29833a3a407c9433f1880dce41", "ja": "はぁ……緊張した……。\nあんなに距離が近くなっちゃうなんて……。", "zh": "哈啊……紧张死我了……  \n没想到会靠得那么近……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a750bf3210825d0f579cb944b341c904b813ff20d6afbecd21d570ba615ab57c", "ja": "風花、体調は大丈夫か？　\n電車の中が、あんなに混んでるとはな……。", "zh": "风花，身体还好吗？没想到电车里会这么拥挤……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3a76d316bfb82950c84171892ebc6e9066a9eb41bcd20462fe5628374f2a6ecf", "ja": "あ、はい！　私は平気です。\n{$P$}さんこそ、大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "啊，好的！我没事。\n倒是{$P$}先生，您还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "276060cb4d339f45c3d5808788e796e982e54400459a0c0529bf2f5807dce5f2", "ja": "ずっと私のこと……その、守ってくれてました、よね。\n腕が痺れたりとか、背中が痛いとか……。", "zh": "一直以来……那个，您都在保护我，对吧。手臂发麻、背痛什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2d13f4ff7526e50eb57d1378b9aeea45caec9f57fd5e2d852c7c1fba4cabb584", "ja": "ははっ、あれぐらい問題ないよ。", "zh": "哈哈，那点程度没什么问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "edbc5f7df8e937d34349c8e84a1cb9b04b41c2ae2c368e96c107270394a7d659", "ja": "それならいいんですけど。\nなんだか今日は、振り回しちゃった気がして……。", "zh": "那就好。\n总觉得今天好像一直在麻烦你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d09b9d1d640c68a9c52f6ff65f3d7e0417343e6db3fe85773bb51220f2b90eaf", "ja": "そんなことないよ。買い物も楽しかったし。\n風花も、いつもより楽しそうだったしな。", "zh": "没那回事。买东西也很开心。\n而且风花看起来也比平时更开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "12c55d0cc5ddfc3e3dd032f6c019d1505ea1440418072ac0644005c841183137", "ja": "えっ？　わ、私……そんなに楽しそうでしたか？", "zh": "咦？我、我……真的看起来那么开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0139d2711a7c7d911bdf05b78f60524de96b30346056f3588b4571de269355a6", "ja": "ああ。猫のぬいぐるみを持って……にゃん。", "zh": "是啊。还抱着猫咪玩偶……喵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5269343556b5bd09a438173a79068ebf5db09a733fb267bacddb8f09062b07ca", "ja": "あ、あれは！　って、{$P$}さん！\nなに笑ってるんですか～！", "zh": "啊、那个是！等等，{$P$}先生！\n你在笑什么呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e1c4ba8e169d89559840b5f3423ec607e88d5e1c8a88fc530cab40e0e78727a9", "ja": "もう……。でも楽しかったのは、本当なんですよ。\n自分でも、少し浮かれてるなって思うくらい。", "zh": "真是的……不过玩得很开心可是真的哦。\n甚至连我自己都觉得自己有点得意忘形了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4337ed56ebffa3f84f5df4deb28e56adb374325164abdf1f9e6c4d976f3c7220", "ja": "それだけ、すごく素敵な時間だったから……。\n今日は、付き合ってくれてありがとうございます。", "zh": "因为那真的是一段非常美好的时光……  \n谢谢你今天愿意陪着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1013_p", "source_sha256": "658856e2d480ec0a5a5e588c6376bc3db6e739d483c753aa849457c94f66486b", "ja": "いや、こちらこそ。ありがとな。", "zh": "不，我才要谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b461761a75d43f08f0892cb799bf832f17195661e6b4628ac9a7d89d085f8f00", "ja": "それと、とってもかわいくて\n素敵なクリスマスプレゼントも。……大事にしますね。", "zh": "还有那份特别可爱又棒的圣诞礼物……我会好好珍惜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1015_p", "source_sha256": "970dc338ca58ef179f19c77c4d18ab258e7f4e8151b8c2d0e2ab0441d7ebe953", "ja": "ああ。気に入ってくれたみたいで嬉しいよ。\n俺も風花に選んでもらったお返し、大切にするよ。", "zh": "啊，你好像很喜欢，我很高兴。\n我也会好好珍惜风花帮我挑的回礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f9df252e7c26c3b3ef70329eb1b2b79bfa05f2fdb276d0b46f5bfc9238a7b671", "ja": "ふふっ、はい。でもプレゼントのお返しはしましたけど\n今日、付き合ってくれたお礼がまだ……。", "zh": "呵呵，是的。不过，礼物的回礼是送了，可今天陪我一起的谢礼还没……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1017_p", "source_sha256": "808918f9e1d10989ea136e29b707a65c05cf651b6b740f777968d88d3b00eae6", "ja": "ん？　それなら、もう貰ったよ。\n風花の楽しそうな顔が、何よりのお返しだ。", "zh": "嗯？那样的话，我已经收到了哦。\n风花开心的表情，就是最好的回礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9ebf618df20c40a8dae58250f3254cf2b4b1e80f3dd2ef0e97fd39f9c7966cd8", "ja": "{$P$}さん……！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ea3f6f669ffc31a162432e1ab04cf265b2834c5daf5ed6952fb3cfb4bb50b27a", "ja": "おっと、そろそろお店に移動しようか。\n予約の時間に遅れそうだ。", "zh": "哎呀，差不多该去店里了吧。要赶不上预约的时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0f525ca63ca1adacdb14e41788ee130eb4867f6de75163000d1757eb951d607f", "ja": "そ、そうですね。一日歩き回りましたし、\n美味しいもの、たくさん食べましょうね♪", "zh": "是、是啊。我们逛了一整天，\n一起多吃点好吃的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0404_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d265369d8ef3fd6647bf847d7d03b4421a3664bde14bce56947eaa268925b218", "ja": "でも、アルコールは程々に！\n{$P$}さんの健康は私が守りますね。", "zh": "不过，酒还是要适量！\n{$P$}先生的健康就由我来守护吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
